    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Strategically located three bed mid terrace residence in this most convenient location with potential subject to planning permission for extension to rear or existing property.\r\n\r\nThe property itself has been vacant for a number of years and as a result benefits from all Vacant Property Refurbishment Grants.\r\n\r\nLarge enclosed rear garden is a feature of the property and add that to the location, only a short stroll to UCC, Bons Secours Hospital, CUH and Cork City Centre.\r\n\r\nThis property should make an excellent proposition for investors or a homeowner.\r\n\r\nNote: The property is in need of renovation and modernisation."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION COMPRISES;\r\n\r\nReception Hall 20’ x 6’;\r\nUnderstairs storage. Tile floor.\r\n1 Power Point. 1 Light.\r\n\r\nLiving Room 12’8’ x 11’; \r\nFireplace. Timber floor.\r\n6 Power Points. 1 Window. 1 Light. 2 Wall Lights.\r\n\r\nDining Room 12’9’ x 9’\r\nFireplace. Timber floor.\r\n4 Power Points. 1 Window. 1 Light. \r\n\r\nKitchen 12’2’ x 9’10’\r\nPlumbed for kitchen appliances & sink.\r\n6 Power Points. 1 Window. 1 Light.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nLanding Area;\r\n1 Light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 19’8’ x 11’9’;\r\nTimber floor.\r\n4 Power Points. 2 Windows. 1 Light. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 12’ x 8’6’;\r\nTimber floor.\r\n3 Power Points. 1 Window. 1 Light. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 10’ x 6’6’;\r\nTimber floor.\r\n1 Power Point. 1 Window. 1 Light. \r\n\r\nBathroom 10’4’ x 4’7’;\r\nWhite Suite. Hot Press.\r\n1 Light. 1 Window. \r\n\r\nGarden shed & rear garden 20’ x 9’\r\n\r\nParking:\r\nOff street parking to front elevation for up to 4 in number cars.\r\n\r\nSERVICES:\r\nAll main services to hand."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Convenient location.\r\nLarge enclosed garden to rear. \r\nBenefits from Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant.\r\nOff street parking and front elevation.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: - Note the above particulars are confidential and are given on the strict understanding that all negotiations shall be conducted through this firm.  Every care has been taken in their preparation, but we do not hold ourselves responsible for any inaccuracies.  All reasonable offers will be submitted to the owners for consideration."
      },
